# App empty copy

## Two surfaces only

1. **Status line** — in-flow hint while the page still has structure (`CatalogStatusLine` / `market-page-status`, `OsAppChromePageStatus`). One short sentence. No icon. Stable line box (`min-height`) so late copy does not shove the section below.
2. **True empty** — compose `market-page-empty` or `standing-panel-empty-state` (+ optional `OsEmptyAction`). Do not invent a third empty tree.

## Stable first paint

When a status line can appear above a personal band (Market Yours / sales), wait until browse + sales settle so the hint and that band paint together. Prefer `CatalogStatusLine` for catalog status; morph looking → no matches in the same slot.

## Voice

Shared universals live in `@/lib/empty-copy` (`noMatches`, `nothingHereYet`, …). Domain lines stay local and human (`No fans yet.`, feed lens empties).

## Do not

- Slap a decorative Mage glyph (e.g. cup-hot) on every empty
- Turn status hints into hero empty cards when content continues below
- Hand-roll underlined recovery links — use `OsEmptyAction`
- Mount Yours/sales before the empty-browse status decision when that would shove them down
